{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a97f7c64-3bed-8621-96b8-61f9a08001de",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T11:37:37-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ileana Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:34:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Merry Christmas Eve, almost. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:34:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin. Yeah, same to you. My name is Ileana Cordero, and I'm calling about the storm drain in front of my neighbor's house, actually. Twenty-five Harrison Avenue, the Fort Adams side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:34:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-five Harrison Avenue. Okay, and what's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:34:53-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's grunting. That's the only word I got for it. It gurgles and goes slow, and any time we get a thaw, the water just sits there and backs up into the street. And it's not even raining. It's dry out. That's what gets me. Nothing's falling from the sky and I got a pond out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:35:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So no storm, just meltwater or whatever's running down and it can't get away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:35:19-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And this isn't the first time. It keeps happening, every thaw, and nobody comes. I went out there myself yesterday and pulled the leaves off the grate by hand. Wet, nasty leaves. It worked for about ten minutes and then it was right back to the same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:35:37-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good on you for clearing it. Ten minutes tells me it's something down in the line, not just the top. Let me get this down. Twenty-five Harrison, drain slow and backing up on thaws, leaves cleared by hand, only helped briefly. Is the water getting up onto anybody's property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:35:55-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It gets right up to the edge of the driveway. Not in the house, not yet. But the whole curb is a lake and it freezes at night. Then you got an ice rink. At my age I'm not walking on that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:36:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, definitely not. Okay, I can put that in as a drainage complaint."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:36:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So will you open a work order? That's what I want to know. And for what date? Because I've heard we'll look into it before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:36:25-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll open a work order right now. As for a date, I can't tell you a day for sure. What I can tell you is it goes to the crew supervisor, and with the holiday this week it may be after New Year's before somebody's out there. I'll flag the ice part so it gets looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:36:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After New Year's. Well. At least it's on paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:36:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It'll be on paper. Do you want a callback number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:36:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-eight. That's my cell, and bear with me, I'm shopping for a better phone plan, so the reception's been lousy. If it cuts out, call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:37:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-eight. Got it. And it's under Cordero, C-O-R-D-E-R-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:37:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Ileana, I-L-E-A-N-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:37:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. So I've got the work order for the Harrison Avenue drain, noted for the ice, and somebody will call you with a date once the crew schedules it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:37:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll believe it when I see the truck. But thank you, Kevin. I appreciate you writing it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:37:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime. Stay warm, and have a good holiday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:37:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
